SUMMARY:Christmas in July... & August at Smart Financial Centre
DESCRIPTION:Smart Financial Centre in Sugar Land presents Christmas in July… and August\, releasing tickets to four holiday shows\, presenting something for every Christmas-loving member. \n\nLeslie Odom\, Jr’s The Christmas Tour | Friday\, November 28 – $72+. 8pm. Get tickets.\nA Magical Cirque Christmas | Tuesday\, December 8 – $35+. 7:30pm. Get tickets.\nLove Actually Live in Concert | Sunday\, December 27 – $28+. 2pm and 7:30pm. Get tickets.\nNutcracker! Magical Christmas Ballet | Tuesday\, December 29 – $27+. 7pm. Get tickets.\n\nAdmission\nTicket pricing varies by show. Order tickets or learn more. \n \nThis Featured Calendar Listing was sponsored by the event organizer and boosted in our calendar with images and more details. \nLearn more about promoting your event\, organization\, business\, or offer across all of our channels. 
URL:https://365thingsinhouston.com/calendar/christmas-in-july-august-at-smart-financial-centre/
LOCATION:Smart Financial Centre at Sugar Land\, 18111 Lexington Blvd\, Sugar Land\, TX\, 77479\, United States
CATEGORIES:Arts Performances,Boosted Calendar Listing,Christmas,Concerts & Live Music,Date Night,Featured,Kids & Families,Live Theater,Movies,Variety Shows
