SUMMARY:Houston Rockets Youth Basketball Camp at The Den Sports Facility
DESCRIPTION:Houston Rockets host the return of the Youth Basketball Skills Camp for summer 2026 with four sessions designed to help young players grow their game and build confidence on the court. \nParticipating boys and girls ages 8 to 16 will learn from experienced coaches through a fun\, structured curriculum developed by Rockets legend Matt Bullard. \nEach day runs from 9am to 3pm\, focuses on key fundamentals like shooting\, ball-handling\, footwork\, and agility in an encouraging\, high-energy environment. \nCamps are designed to give young athletes an unforgettable summer experience through high-level basketball training\, skill development\, confidence building and fun—both on and off the court. \nRocket Skills Camps 2026 Around Houston \n\nAlodia Basketball Academy in Tomball | Monday\, June 1 to Friday\, June 5\nTellepsen Family Downtown YMCA | Monday\, June 15 to Friday\, June 19\nToyota Center in Downtown | Monday\, July 13 to Friday\, June 17\nThe Den Sports Facility in Cypress | Monday\, July 27 to Friday\, July 31\n\nRegistration\nThe weeklong camps are $450. Register for camps or learn more. \n \nThis Featured Calendar Listing was sponsored by the event organizer and boosted in our calendar with images and more details. \nLearn more about promoting your event\, organization\, business\, or offer across all of our channels.
URL:https://365thingsinhouston.com/calendar/houston-rockets-youth-basketball-camp-at-the-den-sports-facility/
LOCATION:The Den Sports Facility\, 17120 House Hahl Rd\, Cypress\, 77433\, United States
CATEGORIES:Boosted Calendar Listing,Classes + Workshops,Featured,Fitness,Health & Wellness,Kids & Families,Kids Camps,Sports & Athletics
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/webp:https://365thingsinhouston.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/rockets-skills-camp-1080x1350-1.webp
END:VEVENT
