SUMMARY:Catastrophic Theatre: Tamarie’s Greatest Hits\, Volume 3 at MATCH
DESCRIPTION:The Catastrophic Theatre presents Tamarie’s Greatest Hits\, Volume 3—marking Houston’s third full decade of an original annual summer musical created by Tamarie Cooper—at MATCH in Midtown. \nEach year\, this Houston institution with a cult following debuts a brand new production— showcasing wildly irreverent scripts\, riotously funny songs\, wackadoodle dances\, spectacular sets\, large casts of quadruple-threat performers\, a small but mighty band\, and Tamarie herself. \nEvery ten years\, she creates a greatest hits show\, featuring the best moments from a decade of great moments with a ridiculous new script and a couple brand-spanking new songs to tie the whole thing together. \nAdmission\nTickets are Pay-What-You-Can\, with a suggested price of $40. Order tickets or learn more. \n  \n \nThis Featured Calendar Listing was sponsored by the event organizer and boosted in our calendar with images and more details. \nLearn more about promoting your event\, organization\, business\, or offer across all of our channels. 
URL:https://365thingsinhouston.com/calendar/the-catastrophic-theatre-tamaries-greatest-hits-volume-3-at-match-22/
LOCATION:MATCH: Midtown Arts & Theater Center Houston\, 3400 Main St\, Houston\, TX\, 77002\, United States
CATEGORIES:Arts Performances,Boosted Calendar Listing,Comedy,Featured,Live Theater,Musicals
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://365thingsinhouston.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/The-Catastrophic-Theatre-Tamaries-Greatest-Hits-Volume-3-at-MATCH.jpg
