SUMMARY:4th Annual White Linen Market at M-K-T
DESCRIPTION:For White Linen Night\, M-K-T in the Heights teams up again with Houston Plant Market for the fourth edition of the M-K-T White Linen Market. \nCelebrating local businesses\, art\, music\, and more\, the free\, all ages\, dog-friendly event offers plenty of space to spread out and soak up great vibes while sipping\, shopping\, and partying during the annual White Linen Night in The Heights. \nEureka Heights Brew Co. and A Force of Nature will be serving tasty free beer and water. Plus there will be raffle offering $1\,200 in prizes from M-K-T shopping\, dining\, and wellness businesses. \nThe open-air night market will feature unique treasures\, plants\, accessories\, art\, sweet treats\, and curated pop-ups from a diverse H-town community of creative artisans and vendors \nA variety of roaming entertainers\, local musicians\, interactive hula hooping performances\, and in-store DJs will enhance the block-party atmosphere. \nCheck out all details\, activities\, specials and more. \nAdmission\nFree. Learn more. \n \nThis Featured Calendar Listing was sponsored by the event organizer and boosted in our calendar with images and more details. \nLearn more about promoting your event\, organization\, business\, or offer across all of our channels.
URL:https://365thingsinhouston.com/calendar/4th-annual-white-linen-market-at-m-k-t/
LOCATION:M-K-T\, 600 N Shepherd Dr\, Houston\, TX\, 77007\, United States
CATEGORIES:Beauty, Fashion & Style,Beer & Breweries,Boosted Calendar Listing,Date Night,Dogs,Drinks & Cocktails,Fashion,Featured,Festivals,Food,Free,History & Culture,Kids & Families,Markets,Mixers,Nightlife,Outdoors,Parties,Plants,Pop-Ups,Shopping & Retail,Swag,Vendors,Wine
