SUMMARY:Garbage Girlfriend Album Release Show at House of Blues
DESCRIPTION:Houston’s breakout all-female rock band Garbage Girlfriend celebrates the release of their self-titled debut album with a full-album live performance\, plus select covers\, in The Bronze Peacock Room at House of Blues \nKnown for sharp original songs and high-energy shows\, Garbage Girlfriend has been building momentum on stages across Houston and Texas. \nThe album release show also features sets by Awaiting Abigail\, Sasser\, and AV8. \nDoors at 7pm. All ages are welcome. \nAdmission\nTickets are $20. Order tickets or learn more. \n \nThis Featured Calendar Listing was sponsored by the event organizer and boosted in our calendar with images and more details. \nLearn more about promoting your event\, organization\, business\, or offer across all of our channels. 
