SUMMARY:Bun B Presents Been Ridin' Dirty at Smart Financial Centre
DESCRIPTION:Smart Financial Centre welcomes Bun B Presents Been Ridin’ Dirty—a one-night only live show commemorating the 30th anniversary of U.G.K.’s landmark 1996 album Ridin’ Dirty—on the Sugar Land stage. \nBun B will joined on stage by special guests Big K.R.I.T.\, Lil’ Keke\, Slim Thug\, David Banner\, 8Ball & MJG\, LE$\, Chamillionaire\, Killa Kyleon\, Botany boyz\, Z-ro\, Devin the Dude\, and more. \nWidely regarded as a defining work in Southern hip hop\, Ridin’ Dirty introduced a sound while capturing a distinct cultural point of view at a pivotal moment in the genre’s evolution. \nThe evening will unfold as a complete presentation of Ridin’ Dirty\, performed in sequence & interpreted through a thoughtfully constructed live production. \nEach track is situated within a broader narrative\, drawing from the environments & lived experiences that informed the album\, offering a cohesive\, start-to-finish reflection of its impact. \nBun B will be at the center of the performance\, anchoring the night not only as an artist\, but as a steward of the legacy. \nAdmission\nTickets start at $35. Order tickets or learn more. \n \nThis Featured Calendar Listing was sponsored by the event organizer and boosted in our calendar with images and more details. \nLearn more about promoting your event\, organization\, business\, or offer across all of our channels. 
URL:https://365thingsinhouston.com/calendar/bun-b-presents-been-ridin-dirty-at-smart-financial-centre/
LOCATION:Smart Financial Centre at Sugar Land\, 18111 Lexington Blvd\, Sugar Land\, TX\, 77479\, United States
CATEGORIES:Boosted Calendar Listing,Concerts & Live Music,Date Night,Featured,History & Culture,Nightlife
