SUMMARY:Hot Wheels Monster Trucks Live: Glow-N-Fire at Toyota Center
DESCRIPTION:Toyota Center welcomes Hot Wheels Monster Trucks Live: Glow-N-Fire back to Houston for 2 shows featuring more monster truck heat and action. \nFans and families will be among the first to see the all-new Rhinomite truck\, plus never-before-seen stunts by the Hot Wheels Monster Trucks\, and tricks like the all-new No-Handed Front Flip performed by the FMX riders. \nGuests can also enhance the experience at pre-show party options and get up close and personal with the monster trucks. \nAdmission\nTickets start at $27. Get tickets or learn more. \n \nThis Featured Calendar Listing was sponsored by the event organizer and boosted in our calendar with images and more details. \nLearn more about promoting your event\, organization\, business\, or offer across all of our channels. 
