SUMMARY:Big3 at Toyota Center
DESCRIPTION:Toyota Center welcomes Big3\, a professional 3-on-3 half-court basketball league co-founded by Ice Cube\, to the Downtown arena’s court for 2 games on Sunday\, July 26\, 2026 and Thursday\, August 6\, 2026. \nJust one ticket gets admission to both games\, which combine basketball\, entertainment\, and family fun and \nBig3 Game Schedule\n\nDMV Trilogy vs. Miami 305 | Sunday\, July 26\, 2026 at 11:30am\nHouston Rig Hands vs. Dallas Power | Thursday\, August 6\, 2026 at 7pm\n\nAdmission\nTickets are $45 and a single ticket admits you to both games. Get tickets or learn more. \n \nThis Featured Calendar Listing was sponsored by the event organizer and boosted in our calendar with images and more details. \nLearn more about promoting your event\, organization\, business\, or offer across all of our channels. 
URL:https://365thingsinhouston.com/calendar/big3-at-toyota-center-2/
LOCATION:Toyota Center\, 1510 Polk St\, Houston\, TX\, 77002\, United States
CATEGORIES:Boosted Calendar Listing,Featured,Kids & Families,Sports & Athletics
